{"id": "q0130", "pool": "frozen", "arm": "aggressive", "tier": "aggressive", "lang": "en", "run_id": "ttfa1", "attempt": 1, "seed": 2173799612, "protocol": "ttfa-v3", "config_sha256": "c1188d4ab398808355719c420f025bd920b27aba798f5596eb328457a751cc63", "gate_art_sha256": "0e6494c2eeac9bcd86c10b5def3cbd32e98bb0765fa2fd8afc8c1b47915ea372", "threshold": 0.5533501505851746, "gpu": "NVIDIA H100 80GB HBM3", "host": "modal", "shard": 7, "query": "Simplify $\\frac{1+\\sqrt{2}}{2+\\sqrt{3}}$. Your solution can be converted to the form $A(1+\\sqrt{B})-(\\sqrt{C}+\\sqrt{D})$, where $A$, $B$, $C$, and $D$ are positive integers. What is $A+B+C+D$?\n\nSolve and give the final answer.", "input_path": "/data/audio_pool/q0130.wav", "input_sha256": "9481880189fdb3cb8e185387777b47db300a5abb72179d4d9d03169002856cf2", "input_samples": 222000, "input_s": 13.875, "n_real_chunks": 14, "score": 0.8513, "act": 0.9956, "is_info": true, "fired": true, "mode": "escalated", "answer": "", "relay_text": "Assuming the fraction is: \\[ \\frac{1}{1+\\sqrt{2}} \\] Rationalize the denominator: \\[ \\frac{1}{1+\\sqrt{2}} \\cdot \\frac{1-\\sqrt{2}}{1-\\sqrt{2}} = \\frac{1-\\sqrt{2}}{1-2} = \\frac{1-\\sqrt{2}}{-1} = \\sqrt{2}-1 \\] So the simplified form is: \\[ \\boxed{\\sqrt{2}-1} \\] If your problem intended a form like \\(\\frac{a+\\sqrt{b}}{c}\\) and asks for \\(a+b+c+d\\), please resend the exact original fraction, because the wording appears garbled.", "expert_answer": "Assuming the fraction is:\n\n\\[\n\\frac{1}{1+\\sqrt{2}}\n\\]\n\nRationalize the denominator:\n\n\\[\n\\frac{1}{1+\\sqrt{2}} \\cdot \\frac{1-\\sqrt{2}}{1-\\sqrt{2}}\n=\n\\frac{1-\\sqrt{2}}{1-2}\n=\n\\frac{1-\\sqrt{2}}{-1}\n=\n\\sqrt{2}-1\n\\]\n\nSo the simplified form is:\n\n\\[\n\\boxed{\\sqrt{2}-1}\n\\]\n\nIf your problem intended a form like \\(\\frac{a+\\sqrt{b}}{c}\\) and asks for \\(a+b+c+d\\), please resend the exact original fraction, because the wording appears garbled.", "transcript": "Simplify the fraction 1 plus square root 2. Your solution can be converted to the form a plus square root b, in demanded doll, where a, b, c dollars, and d dollar are positive integers. What is plus d? Solve and give the final answer.\n", "asr_s": 1.46, "expert_s": 9.49, "expert_input_samples": 222000, "expert_input_s": 13.875, "expert_input_sha256": "9481880189fdb3cb8e185387777b47db300a5abb72179d4d9d03169002856cf2", "expert_timed_out": false, "wait_s": 8.645, "relay_synth_ms": 159169, "onset_chunk": 14, "eot_seen": false, "n_speak_chunks": 1, "feed_lag_max_ms": 1145, "feed_lag_sum_ms": 1145, "audio_files": {"relay": {"path": "/data/ttfa_real/ttfa1/frozen/audio/q0130_aggressive_relay.wav", "sha256": "67b5d198d85423609feb9868394786410becc71e85683b9b039e88946857787f", "sr": 24000, "seconds": 278.28}, "candidate": {"path": "/data/ttfa_real/ttfa1/frozen/audio/q0130_aggressive_candidate.wav", "sha256": "27686ad7fbad8bfe41b7029f921bbd006d9639422bb8aa237aeb263dfe441f24", "sr": 24000, "seconds": 1.0}, "stall": {"path": "/data/ttfa_real/ttfa1/frozen/audio/q0130_aggressive_stall.wav", "sha256": "7a524c6089a1a7b9af4bb2e5089467a6a6ce8cb4656a7af59106f9eb4cc7436c", "sr": 24000, "seconds": 2.28}}, "chunks": [[0, 1, 1.0, 1.084, 1.15, 1, 0, 0], [1, 1, 2.0, 2.077, 2.138, 1, 0, 0], [2, 1, 3.0, 3.078, 3.138, 1, 0, 0], [3, 1, 4.0, 4.073, 4.136, 1, 0, 0], [4, 1, 5.0, 5.075, 5.135, 1, 0, 0], [5, 1, 6.0, 6.081, 6.147, 1, 0, 0], [6, 1, 7.0, 7.081, 7.146, 1, 0, 0], [7, 1, 8.0, 8.076, 8.136, 1, 0, 0], [8, 1, 9.0, 9.08, 9.146, 1, 0, 0], [9, 1, 10.0, 10.077, 10.136, 1, 0, 0], [10, 1, 11.0, 11.08, 11.144, 1, 0, 0], [11, 1, 12.0, 12.082, 12.146, 1, 0, 0], [12, 1, 13.0, 13.082, 13.144, 1, 0, 0], [13, 1, 13.875, 13.963, 14.032, 1, 0, 0], [14, 0, 14.875, 14.952, 15.691, 0, 24000, 0], [15, 0, 15.875, 17.107, 17.994, 0, 30720, 1]], "status": "completed", "error": null, "ts": {"feed_start": 0.0, "input_end": 13.875, "last_real_feed_done": 13.963, "onset": 15.691, "gate_read_done": 15.692, "fire": 15.692, "candidate_first_pcm": 15.691, "sta